      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}: I used to only use my quest for logging in, and I also merged my account so I could have ranks and an actual VRC name. I've since moved to pc and I cannot merge my steam account to my existing account because it has already been merged with my oculus one. The only way for me to login on pc is by the VRC login next to the steam one.\n\nIf I use the steam login then it just creates another account for me which I can't merge to my current one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
