      "value": "@{637af82c032efc555e56c41d|full_name}: Hmmm, you *should* be able to merge your Steam account with your VRChat account, even if you've already merged an Oculus account - unless I've misunderstood something about the process.\n\nIt should work the same way as merging your Oculus account:\n\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062659053-I-want-to-turn-my-Steam-Oculus-or-Viveport-account-into-a-VRChat-account\n\nIf you need further assistance, you may want to contact our customer service: https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new",
